Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"602a486d-9e24-4bef-8d69-40b372d7bdc4"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ddfc4841-a16a-4b8e-8c3e-8a922c134543"],

